{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "ce6865565de02e3a3a80df0f3d91d90cf70467770c0dcecdd555900a1923268b", "ja": "繋がれたるもの", "zh": "被缚之人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4447bf767aac2274c0784dee406c9cae68b29a7e67ccc46e1e9b30e2dcd6c404", "ja": "魔女の森で封印を解こうとした星梨花達は、\n絶滅したはずのドラゴンに襲われる。救出に\n向かおうとする千鶴と風花。同行を名乗り\n出た歌織を風花は止めようとするが、千鶴が\n後押し、学園長が彼女に許可を出す。", "zh": "星梨花等人在女巫之森试图解除封印时，遭到了本应已经灭绝的龙袭击。千鹤和风花准备前去救援。歌织主动提出同行，风花想要阻止她，但千鹤出言支持，校长也批准了她的请求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "c20098e086e2488eb3e2a6f888d07090b2705308d1128e4e75141f2888e03d6e", "ja": "すごい……大気が、強いマナに満ちてる……。\nこれが、魔女の森……。", "zh": "好厉害……空气中充满了强大的魔力……  \n这就是女巫森林……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "c42fb48635ee2171ec75063e1df71b647795bbb201c5505241df77a98f2e144d", "ja": "この辺りに、極光の涙石が封印されているみたいだね。\nたしか目印が……あっ、あの木じゃない？", "zh": "看来，极光之泪石就封印在这附近呢。记得标志是……啊，是那棵树吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "d9425cf9444d50289761f91b3e042536aac2c78e0c49252afd47ab514246c1f6", "ja": "封印を解く前に、まずはトラップを確認しますね。\nきっと、ド派手で大きいのが……あれ？", "zh": "在解开封印之前，先确认一下陷阱吧。\n肯定会有特别夸张又大的陷阱……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "d21c099281b1d8c05bf6fa431fc26fc5863b6faef8a79cb6a914b11bd6a8f439", "ja": "罠がひとつもないなんて、そんなはずは……。\nううん。それ以前に、封印がすべて解かれている……？", "zh": "居然一个陷阱都没有，不可能会这样……。\n不对。在那之前，封印竟然全都解开了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1004_se", "source_sha256": "fd17c75312f717d27dccb144c54816032d654cc44d23d384afe332412a4384d6", "ja": "…………ヴォン！", "zh": "…………嗡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "c2208b318755e71c65614a51d2978de78404ba7e564daf97b9fd7c3e91839bc2", "ja": "！？　術式が、勝手に発動して……！？\nちょっとユリコ、どういうこと！？", "zh": "！？术式自己发动了……！？尤莉子，你这是怎么回事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "a574fbc7dd10dc929c1cd0aecf6fa6b369d43d8aeb59f160245586571112fef0", "ja": "ええっ！？　で、でも、私の探知魔法には、\n何の反応もないままで……ああっ！？", "zh": "诶！？可、可是，我的探知魔法完全没有任何反应……啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1007_doragon", "source_sha256": "6df2522e4e9feb887b98897c0c31fd0b7fd82f79f005472b27da6e5ef2096a0a", "ja": "ギャオオオォォォォーンッ！", "zh": "嘎哦哦哦哦哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "5d892c22e311e5840197233cb6d4b4dbf01c2ad0fdc4f321f402cf8aa0cc5555", "ja": "うそ……ドラゴン！？\n魔法界でもとっくに絶滅したはずでしょ！？", "zh": "骗人的吧……龙！？\n在魔法界应该也早就灭绝了才对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "e52e42b2d97bbc480586a35b26156d1edcada179dcfdddebca597280bed2f30d", "ja": "くっ……幻獣なんかに、負けたりしない！\nおいで、ジュニオール！　あいつをやっつけて！", "zh": "呃……我才不会输给什么幻兽！\n上吧，朱尼奥尔！把那家伙打倒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1010_junior", "source_sha256": "a27e1a5c8a3a63d557db0602ebc5918133eda8120d94b720958de9bea6c42734", "ja": "ワオォーンッ！", "zh": "嗷呜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1011_doragon", "source_sha256": "3718ed40caf2aeee9b94ae5852cd4047f0b517bf81dd0ae0cbe344bacda36561", "ja": "グオオオォォォッ！", "zh": "咕哦哦哦哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1012_junior", "source_sha256": "c795e3599c22b5669411f98e470808793c9ef7a54c6cbe2db9fb08bfc567ad98", "ja": "キャンッ！？", "zh": "呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "db2cd5d15dfacc066cb3dfb8ed99d413a90e2ee93793a7080b320565a47d03d7", "ja": "ジュニオール！？　そんな、ジュニオールが\nこんな簡単にやられるなんて……！", "zh": "小俊！？怎么会，小俊居然这么轻易就被打败了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1014_null", "source_sha256": "54c69f77475fded8c36448c8648b0d10b5a2d4a52eac396d4a357e635146ebec", "ja": "グルルルル……ガオオォォーッ！", "zh": "咕噜噜噜……嗷呜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "ad314a5480b23a9e4defadc6725183aa59eb045d6689221d09aec72a4c2dd4a7", "ja": "っ！？　おまえは……！", "zh": "呃！？你是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1017_syokuin", "source_sha256": "93e43a9066a5ccc0a9b7ffb435ca66bd936f973a0464ade0ec3824e51f52acce", "ja": "大変です、学園長！　魔女の森で、ドラゴンが暴れて\nいるとの連絡が！　学園の生徒が忍び込んだようで……", "zh": "大事不好了，学园长！有消息称，魔女之森里\n有巨龙在作乱！似乎是学园的学生偷偷潜进去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "3e9fd1b38adf180d89f01abc76419a8f2b8cc329c8ed5c0a7a9e345faab6b3ca", "ja": "ど、ドラゴン！？\n古代魔法の影響が、そんな物にまで……。", "zh": "龙、龙！？\n古代魔法的影响，竟然连那种东西都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "b199ea0a2669668c07c63d26f9c4833dec0c3e3073768ab88a2025064c1bfb6a", "ja": "いったい、誰が魔女の森に入ったんですか～？\nあそこは禁忌ですよ～？", "zh": "到底是谁进入了魔女之森啊～？\n那里可是禁地哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "1f5fd1b30ca96734b98e8727a8b1c6374278e1edd720b9b95cafe63dd16cab0b", "ja": "お説教は後ですよ、トモカ！\nとにかく、生徒達を助けないと！", "zh": "说教的事之后再说，朋花！\n总之，得先救出学生们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "195409a88fa7a85486f10f5cc3b7f57fb14d8d26f2c14304050751abbd7010e0", "ja": "先生方と連絡を取ってください！\n私は先に、森に向かいます！", "zh": "请联系各位老师！\n我先去森林！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "394270c965d5c28d392487e6bd6864a610ffa6d08b5102f896991669f93dd753", "ja": "了解しました～。\n学園長なら、大丈夫だとは思いますが……。", "zh": "知道了～  \n我想，学园长应该没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "0c1bb4c24ce90337cc1cb42146b90a608f92e2e0bac09232c47d5d75d8acbc55", "ja": "魔女の森は、危険な場所です。\nどうかくれぐれも、気をつけてくださいね～？", "zh": "女巫之森是个危险的地方。还请您务必多加小心哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7aa091513dac1645c16bfe82979ef58d695cbe4535c837d33a9ba382bd4cf60d", "ja": "……なんだか騒がしいわね。\n何かあったのかしら？", "zh": "……总觉得有些吵闹呢。\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "f5b579e069fc866a773e12a9a41d60c82847e8fbe5036380eb0c010c34c984c8", "ja": "あ！　千鶴さん、あれ……！", "zh": "啊！千鹤，看那边……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1026_keruberosu", "source_sha256": "3a8e700c3ccd1a47229459c3552216c431785751cdfa1cdba7e71855c1b80b6c", "ja": "グルル……！", "zh": "咕噜噜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "8576533fdddd346fa3e61912c89033ece20fc9e04b7f49197085221dd919c580", "ja": "この声は……ケルベロス！？", "zh": "这个声音是……刻耳柏洛斯！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1028_keruberosu", "source_sha256": "9bda54823de2f3d6bb78f8db1ad71c5748ebd80e15c8a86239826fd3cc83db93", "ja": "クゥーン……", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1029_038chz", "source_sha256": "7da5bec4ba92f3075f400d42e8975d618732243aec392ed834c7261f6c4f3dee", "ja": "ケルベロス、どうしたんだこの傷は……！？\nまさか、星梨花に何かあったのか！？", "zh": "刻耳柏洛斯，这是怎么回事，怎么会有这些伤……！？\n难道是星梨花出了什么事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "519c5f02c017354d71df51d009a5d5b5448747eee188482c2f009c0847c79944", "ja": "強いマナの気配……これは一体、どこから……？\nいえ、その前に治療ね。歌織！", "zh": "好强的魔力气息……这究竟是从哪里传来的……？\n不，先治疗要紧。歌织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "63e1f00be594efa6348ae8454d67a60f7b8abc42512c0fa892483f4360e74c95", "ja": "ええ！　風花ちゃん、千鶴さん、どいていて！\nこの魔法は、効果がとても強いの！", "zh": "好的！风花、千鹤，请让开！\n这个魔法的效果非常强！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1032_se", "source_sha256": "731cf8c2bce5ef16cbefcdd139dbd1977d3965c311d4986d2721e4157634fc67", "ja": "キラッ…………", "zh": "闪闪发亮…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1033_keruberosu", "source_sha256": "2e4840272c906cb1b04789e2d8a4682d4dce5619af7ae792a9289d3765ef8304", "ja": "クゥーン！　グルルル……グルルル！", "zh": "呜——！ 咕噜噜……咕噜噜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "d5de26a8810bd9426b3a512de9b2228784502ec74e4acb2fd7587a52d1337bce", "ja": "ケルベロス、本当に良かった……。\nすまない、歌織。助かった……。", "zh": "刻耳柏洛斯，真的太好了……\n抱歉，歌织。多亏你帮忙了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1035_052kao", "source_sha256": "6562476566cd86b259cf9854a3411fd0c96a46048a5bc76363320eabc1021e09", "ja": "ううん、いいの。……それより、\nケルベロスのケガからも瘴気を感じたわ。", "zh": "不，没关系的。……比起这个，\n在刻耳柏洛斯的伤口处我也感受到了瘴气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1036_keruberosu", "source_sha256": "9a6bff7e37d2ddff764fdd20dab83ad56ecdd3775bbb2148bc78bcaf79bf0944", "ja": "グルル……", "zh": "咕噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "49a4bdfc69f1d6f66fd9b8c72d4bddf10c9f2708f032370d5482e41e2929c3fe", "ja": "そうだな、こうしてはいられない。\nケルベロス、星梨花達のところへ案内してくれ！", "zh": "是啊，不能再这样下去了。\n刻耳柏洛斯，带我去星梨花她们那里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1038_041fuk", "source_sha256": "24544b3169b889a11b88885406937c8a80bb7b9ae08690ae2a564f15f179a149", "ja": "待って千鶴、私も一緒に行くわ。\n歌織は、ここに残って待機を……。", "zh": "等等千鹤，我也一起去。\n歌织就留在这里待命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1039_052kao", "source_sha256": "ed4eadeceae7dc5df055735730a204f0a217361cf6b9d51c3b1b6f022191d334", "ja": "あ、あの！　わ、私も一緒に行きます！\n行きますからね！？　絶対に、行きますから！", "zh": "啊、那个！我、我也要一起去！\n我会去的哦！？绝对会一起去的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "74957b0a171b4b36901a2eea00338b66f75dc1a21d7518cdc20f3c99f9bd8fbf", "ja": "歌織……わかってちょうだい。\nこれは、危険なことなのよ。", "zh": "歌织……你要明白。\n这可是很危险的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "772e6f39d3a20fb36fcafb87020047321f407cbcb0da8fd0ad2ba4c6eb88b5c8", "ja": "私はあなたを、\n危険な目に遭わせたくないの……！", "zh": "我不想让你遭遇危险……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1042_052kao", "source_sha256": "7cf8e3381454832de5183bb3cad78af19b596c97483d54c3124850181384e269", "ja": "風花ちゃんこそ、わかってない！\n私は、危険だからこそ一緒に行きたいの！", "zh": "风花你才是，根本没明白！我正因为危险，才想和你一起去啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1043_052kao", "source_sha256": "14e6a8bb43916cfbe3df4395026d8ec63fc948d38586a6474ed95718039ddd89", "ja": "だって私は、風花ちゃんのパートナーなんだから！", "zh": "因为我是风花的搭档啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "07a23f60167eb850067cb428b73105cae24aefbb3c699e393b14b1d3f821a97b", "ja": "歌織……。", "zh": "歌织……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1045_038chz", "source_sha256": "553680e56644c04431f7a073d124ca4570cfa53aa82824f2396f159e1cd0017c", "ja": "連れていってやればいいじゃないか、風花。\n治癒魔法が使える歌織がいれば、私たちは負けない。", "zh": "带她一起去不就好了吗，风花。有会治愈魔法的歌织在，我们不会输的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1046_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9027cccbf536bfe885f81455d23564593d5d664abed5500cdbea57e27d2d625b", "ja": "でも！\n私はともかく、歌織の魔法は戦闘には……。", "zh": "可是！\n先不说我，歌织的魔法并不适合战斗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1047_025roc", "source_sha256": "820b6d280143f918e9c06b3fa59e252c72684453ace81683f46a318c327551ea", "ja": "私が、同行を許可します！", "zh": "我，批准你们同行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1048_038chz", "source_sha256": "e33abffa2942b6ca3ed5d6d36a7002a282686a91ce4b1a7a4da8dc0f3726c2fb", "ja": "学園長！？", "zh": "校长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1049_052kao", "source_sha256": "e33abffa2942b6ca3ed5d6d36a7002a282686a91ce4b1a7a4da8dc0f3726c2fb", "ja": "学園長！？", "zh": "校长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1050_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e33abffa2942b6ca3ed5d6d36a7002a282686a91ce4b1a7a4da8dc0f3726c2fb", "ja": "学園長！？", "zh": "校长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1051_025roc", "source_sha256": "3b0ae1b474ed09fa0179d723a1034b3b9e57c53da3c856dc6d456cfb7db300f3", "ja": "貴方達を探していました！　チヅル、パートナーの\nピンチです！　戦いの準備はできていますか？", "zh": "我一直在找你们！千鹤，你的搭档有危险！准备好战斗了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1052_038chz", "source_sha256": "2f8afe230b06a6583868419830a673e22740a3c221df65adbbd0f7ed4b1e0a97", "ja": "っ、はい！", "zh": "呃，是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1053_025roc", "source_sha256": "43c1f807a92d84125d8c2fecdbfc814a6656fe78b14fa3e40defbdc0b7e11f48", "ja": "グッドです！　ですが、とても危険です。\n後でみんなに、トランスフォームしてもらいますね！", "zh": "太棒了！不过，这非常危险。\n之后请大家变身吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1054_025roc", "source_sha256": "1776d80c657d43aad3b0ea810277f885a48892adcbb910b1a00211f784c57167", "ja": "さぁ、私に付いてきて！", "zh": "来，跟我走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1055_038chz", "source_sha256": "0b2cfd0220638164c64af80dc950d9a5e29106ce4e780ddf74419a9440fcad4b", "ja": "付いてきてって……どこへですか？", "zh": "“跟着我”……要去哪里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0355_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0355_story_04_1056_025roc", "source_sha256": "b0f81339d52be72fe88f91ad680f83775847f8aa5c9c3b7785745e06fb4f32d3", "ja": "もちろん、魔女の森です！", "zh": "当然是女巫之森啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
